  "html": "\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-wrapper alignfull  root-eb-wrapper-o8ox8\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-wrapper-o8ox8 \"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-outer eb-wrapper-o8ox8\"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-inner\"><div class=\"eb-wrapper-inner-blocks eb-wrapper-align-center\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-row alignfull  root-eb-row-p5wdb\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-row-p5wdb \"><div class=\"eb-row-root-container eb-row-p5wdb\" data-id=\"eb-row-p5wdb\"><div class=\"eb-row-wrapper\"><div class=\"eb-row-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-1q7u7\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-1q7u7 \"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-1q7u7\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-948e8b5\" data-block-id=\"948e8b5\"><style>.stk-948e8b5 {margin-bottom:1px !important;}.stk-948e8b5 .stk-img-wrapper{width:100% !important;height:516px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 767px){.stk-948e8b5 .stk-img-wrapper{width:96% !important;height:176px !important;}}</style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-837\" src=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n.jpg\" width=\"1538\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n.jpg 1538w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-225x300.jpg 225w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-769x1024.jpg 769w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-768x1023.jpg 768w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480577629_122206289336198794_5085059768532657375_n-1154x1536.jpg 1154w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1538px) 100vw, 1538px\" /></span></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-advanced-heading  root-eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5 eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInLeft\"><div class=\"eb-advance-heading-wrapper eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5 button-1 undefined\" data-id=\"eb-advance-heading-xv8x1j5\"><h2 class=\"eb-ah-title\"><span class=\"first-title\"></span></h2><p class=\"eb-ah-subtitle\"><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tf1/1/16/1f4af.png\" alt=\"💯\"> Ieri seară am avut parte de o întâlnire memorabilă la sediul <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/caconnectsrl?__cft__[0]=AZVM-kUOJrUJaA1j3icr6DayUeCDT6yjR3Fu_CKW3WUsHpd_1aKxwVb839zUyAuPMos5bkc_ORyFUbYboXhDKc0ROpVRyQCQFI4joolEGNw8d4wesI57Cfl69OTM4yCZKrS2w0cq_WYWFjSOJyZJ22ZvogyGHxMc5KeqDgK6wRrvm0KgmgSpMS19AcS8uiy4HBAgKpPFpZ3khx9y62a2jL0-nP_RozEeZLqWFrAFywwhYw&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R\">C&amp;A CONNECT SRL</a> , unde <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/romeo.cretu?__cft__[0]=AZVM-kUOJrUJaA1j3icr6DayUeCDT6yjR3Fu_CKW3WUsHpd_1aKxwVb839zUyAuPMos5bkc_ORyFUbYboXhDKc0ROpVRyQCQFI4joolEGNw8d4wesI57Cfl69OTM4yCZKrS2w0cq_WYWFjSOJyZJ22ZvogyGHxMc5KeqDgK6wRrvm0KgmgSpMS19AcS8uiy4HBAgKpPFpZ3khx9y62a2jL0-nP_RozEeZLqWFrAFywwhYw&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R\">Romeo Crețu</a> ne-a oferit o perspectivă clară asupra importanței contextului în discuții. <br><br>Am descoperit că succesul unei conversații depinde de:<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Speța discuției – Alegerea momentului și a cadrului potrivit face diferența între o soluție eficientă și un dialog fără rezultat.<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Energia discuției – Nivelul de implicare și tonul comunicării influențează profunzimea și impactul schimbului de idei.<br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t33/1/16/2705.png\" alt=\"✅\"> Scopul discuției – Fără un obiectiv clar, conversațiile devin vagi și ineficiente. Stabilirea unui scop ajută la obținerea unor rezultate concrete.</p></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-7963165\" data-block-id=\"7963165\"><style>.stk-7963165 {margin-bottom:0px !important;}.stk-7963165 .stk-img-wrapper{width:100% !important;height:416px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 767px){.stk-7963165 .stk-img-wrapper{width:90% !important;height:176px !important;}}</style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-838\" src=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481903838_122206289360198794_2820273200595103189_n.jpg\" width=\"1538\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481903838_122206289360198794_2820273200595103189_n.jpg 1538w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481903838_122206289360198794_2820273200595103189_n-225x300.jpg 225w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481903838_122206289360198794_2820273200595103189_n-769x1024.jpg 769w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481903838_122206289360198794_2820273200595103189_n-768x1023.jpg 768w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/481903838_122206289360198794_2820273200595103189_n-1154x1536.jpg 1154w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1538px) 100vw, 1538px\" /></span></figure></div>\n\n\n\n<p class=\"has-black-color has-text-color has-link-color wp-elements-1 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"margin-top:var(--wp--preset--spacing--small);margin-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-small);margin-bottom:var(--wp--preset--spacing--small);margin-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-small);padding-top:0;padding-right:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-small);padding-bottom:0;padding-left:var(--wp--preset--spacing--x-small);font-size:clamp(14px, 0.875rem + ((1vw - 3.2px) * 0.682), 20px);\">În plus, am avut parte de un moment de provocare, unde am analizat o situație reală ridicată de <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/DIASOSTOPDISTRIB?__cft__[0]=AZVM-kUOJrUJaA1j3icr6DayUeCDT6yjR3Fu_CKW3WUsHpd_1aKxwVb839zUyAuPMos5bkc_ORyFUbYboXhDKc0ROpVRyQCQFI4joolEGNw8d4wesI57Cfl69OTM4yCZKrS2w0cq_WYWFjSOJyZJ22ZvogyGHxMc5KeqDgK6wRrvm0KgmgSpMS19AcS8uiy4HBAgKpPFpZ3khx9y62a2jL0-nP_RozEeZLqWFrAFywwhYw&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R\">Florin Hustiuc</a> , administratorul <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/profile.php?id=100025949178538&amp;__cft__[0]=AZVM-kUOJrUJaA1j3icr6DayUeCDT6yjR3Fu_CKW3WUsHpd_1aKxwVb839zUyAuPMos5bkc_ORyFUbYboXhDKc0ROpVRyQCQFI4joolEGNw8d4wesI57Cfl69OTM4yCZKrS2w0cq_WYWFjSOJyZJ22ZvogyGHxMc5KeqDgK6wRrvm0KgmgSpMS19AcS8uiy4HBAgKpPFpZ3khx9y62a2jL0-nP_RozEeZLqWFrAFywwhYw&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R\">Diasos Top Distrib SRL</a>. <br><br>Împreună, am explorat soluții și am demonstrat că o comunitate puternică de antreprenori găsește mereu răspunsuri și oportunități.<br><br><img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/tcc/1/16/1f4dd.png\" alt=\"📝\"> După întâlnirea săptămânală, a urmat cina, pe care am luat-o împreună la restaurantul <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pizzadejavu.ro?__cft__[0]=AZVM-kUOJrUJaA1j3icr6DayUeCDT6yjR3Fu_CKW3WUsHpd_1aKxwVb839zUyAuPMos5bkc_ORyFUbYboXhDKc0ROpVRyQCQFI4joolEGNw8d4wesI57Cfl69OTM4yCZKrS2w0cq_WYWFjSOJyZJ22ZvogyGHxMc5KeqDgK6wRrvm0KgmgSpMS19AcS8uiy4HBAgKpPFpZ3khx9y62a2jL0-nP_RozEeZLqWFrAFywwhYw&amp;__tn__=-]K-y-R\">Deja Vu Botosani</a> , iar pe această cale îi mulțumim pentru ospitalitate colegei noastre Ioana Boboc. <img decoding=\"async\" height=\"16\" width=\"16\" src=\"https://static.xx.fbcdn.net/images/emoji.php/v9/t4c/1/16/1f642.png\" alt=\"🙂\"><br>Antreprenor din Botoșani, ești pregătit să îți duci afacerea la următorul nivel?<br>Vino la următoarea întâlnire BIZZ.CLUB Botoșani și descoperă puterea networking-ului și a învățării continue!</p>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-stackable-image stk-block-image stk-block stk-471b973\" data-block-id=\"471b973\"><style>.stk-471b973 .stk-img-wrapper{width:100% !important;height:364px !important;}@media screen and (max-width: 767px){.stk-471b973 .stk-img-wrapper{width:85% !important;height:176px !important;}}</style><figure><span class=\"stk-img-wrapper stk-image--shape-stretch\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"stk-img wp-image-840\" src=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480707617_122206289582198794_3121945253911349157_n.jpg\" width=\"1538\" height=\"2048\" srcset=\"https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480707617_122206289582198794_3121945253911349157_n.jpg 1538w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480707617_122206289582198794_3121945253911349157_n-225x300.jpg 225w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480707617_122206289582198794_3121945253911349157_n-769x1024.jpg 769w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480707617_122206289582198794_3121945253911349157_n-768x1023.jpg 768w, https://dezvoltaredigitala.ro/wp-content/uploads/2025/03/480707617_122206289582198794_3121945253911349157_n-1154x1536.jpg 1154w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1538px) 100vw, 1538px\" /></span></figure></div>\n</div></div></div></div>\n\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-column  root-eb-column-yjxdr\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-column-yjxdr \"><div class=\"eb-column-wrapper eb-column-yjxdr\"><div class=\"eb-column-inner\">\n\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-essential-blocks-advanced-heading neobot_categorytitle  root-eb-advance-heading-8bltr\"><div class=\"eb-parent-wrapper eb-parent-eb-advance-heading-8bltr eb_animation eb___animated eb___fadeInRight\"><div class=\"eb-advance-heading-wrapper eb-